{"id":"1a6ec3822e314aff","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-finite-intersection.md","title":"Finite Intersection Property","display":"thm-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-finite-intersection","aliases":["58-thm-finite-intersection"],"display":"thm-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-finite-intersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-finite-intersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-intersection — Finite Intersection Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FIP}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{FIP}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{FIP}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\to\n\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;(x\\in A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{FIP}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\to\n\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;(x\\in A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A family has the finite intersection property if every finite subfamily has nonempty intersection.</li>\n<li>Such families can be extended to ultrafilters using Zorn's lemma.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FIP}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{FIP}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal G)\\to\n\\exists x\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;(x\\in A)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1000,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-finite-intersection.md|58-thm-finite-intersection]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}